==================== Input ====================
/*
 * `@nest` continuation lines indent at +2, how selector lists indent everywhere else.
 * DIVERGES from Prettier (DIVERGENCES.md "nest-params-indent"), which lands at
 * +4 (comma-separated selectors) / +6 (wrapped selector parts),
 * an artifact of its generic at-rule params indent.
 */
a {
  @nest .some-long-prefix-selector &, .another-long-prefix-selector &, .third & {
    order: 2;
  }
}
a {
  @nest .quite-long-descendant-part .another-descendant-part .third-part-more & {
    order: 2;
  }
}
/* fits -> inline, matching Prettier */
a {
  @nest b & {
    order: 1;
  }
}

